---
/** Control Hub: Put ControlHub on Autopilot With AgentHub */
---

<section class="sec sec--white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">AgentHub &middot; early access</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Put ControlHub on Autopilot <em class="s">With AgentHub</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">AI agents work on top of ControlHub. Describe what you want to sell and let agents build it, bill it, and keep it compliant, within the limits you set.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ag rv">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="ag-top"><span class="ag-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9z"/><path d="M4 7.5l8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9"/></svg></span><span class="st st--acc">early access</span></div>
        <h3>Product Ops Agent</h3>
        <p>Describe an offering in plain language. The agent builds the plan, maps it to operator plans, and provisions it on Spenza.</p>
        <div class="ag-ex"><em>&ldquo;2 GB watch plan, UK retail, $9 prepaid&rdquo;</em><br>plan built &middot; mapped to Operator B &middot; ready to publish</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="ag-top"><span class="ag-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/><path d="M7 9.5v5M17 9.5v5"/></svg></span><span class="st st--acc">early access</span></div>
        <h3>Finance Ops Agent</h3>
        <p>Reconciles operator invoices, collects from your customers, and pays operators on time, across every level of your reseller network.</p>
        <div class="ag-ex"><em>Operator B invoice reconciled</em><br>3 lines flagged &middot; customer invoices sent &middot; payouts scheduled</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="ag-top"><span class="ag-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.2-7 10-4-1.8-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><span class="st st--acc">early access</span></div>
        <h3>Compliance Ops Agent</h3>
        <p>Calculates and remits telecom taxes and prepares regulatory reports for each market you sell in.</p>
        <div class="ag-ex"><em>Q3 telecom taxes calculated</em><br>regulatory report drafted &middot; waiting for review</div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="ag-foot rv">
      <p>Choose whether each agent suggests, asks for approval, or acts within the limits you set.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--line" href="#demo">Request early access <i>&rarr;</i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
